   "tutorialStrings": [
    "Alright!  Now that we're on the field\nof battle, let's begin!",
    "The King has granted me one of his\nbest knights, Sir Shepherd, to help\nillustrate the art of combat.",
    "Greetings.",
    "First, let's go over movement.",
    "Try directing Shepherd to move to the\ntarget area.  Simply place your finger\non him, and draw a line to the arrow.",
    "Nice Job!  Pretty simple, right?",
    "You're free to give me commands as\nwell.  A skilled tactician can command\nas many as 4 units at once!",
    "Let's practice a little more - direct\neither me or Shepherd to move to the\nmarked zones.",
    "You've got the idea, let's move on...",
    "Let's try having Shepherd beat up this\ntraining dummy.  It's just like moving,\nsimply draw a line to your target!",
    "As you can see, units will continue to\nattack their target until told otherwise,\nor the target is destroyed.",
    "Wait a moment...  Shepherd, you look\ninjured!",
    "Tis nothing, m'lady, just a scratch.  I\nmerely encountered some goblins on\nmy way here.",
    "Commander, quickly tap Shepherd to\nselect him.  This will display his health\nbar above his head.",
    "As you can see, he's badly hurt!\nFortunately, I happen to be a healer.",
    "Try ordering me to heal Shepherd, it's\njust like an attack command - draw a\nline from me to him.",
    "Thank you, m'lady.",
    "Remember, I will continue to heal my\ntarget until given different orders.",
    "As a cleric, this is my primary function\non the battlefield.  I have no attacks,\nand rely on other units to protect me.",
    "And while my armor is strong, I too\nneed the help of others, or I would\nsurely perish.",
    "Hey, what's that in the sky...?",
    "Ouch, it's a monstrous bat!\nSir Shepherd, help!",
    "My armor helps me withstand damage\nfar better than Lucille.  Direct me to\nstrike this bat to get it's attention!",
    "Well done!  Don't forget, monsters are\ndumb creatures, and will prefer to\nattack your most armored units first.",
    "If a melee unit like Shepherd strikes a\nmonster, it is forced to attack him in\nreturn.",
    "Use this fact to your advantage to help\ncontrol your foes, and protect poorly\narmored units like myself!",
    "We've both taken some damage... this\nwould be a good time to show you\nsome powerful healing magic!",
    "First, select me by giving me a quick\ntap.",
    "When you select a unit, you can see\ntheir special powers in the top-left\ncorner of the screen.",
    "Give that icon a tap to activate my\ngroup heal spell!",
    "Special powers have \"cooldowns\",\nmeaning they can only be used again\nafter some time has elapsed.",
    "Each unit has their own powers, using\nthem at the right time can change the\ntide of battle.",
    "You have now seen the basics of\ncombat - movement, attacking, healing\nand special powers!",
    "It seems the commander is prepared\nenough.  Perhaps we should head into\ntown and make ready?",
    "Let's."
   ],
